-- The published data of the compiler (compiler activities §2, §3): one vocabulary made of
-- its four parts. Closed alternatives are families; codes without payload are closed sets of
-- names; private working state belongs to each activity, not here. Two parts that offered one
-- name would clash here, by spread.

local values = require "nua.compiler.values"
local places = require "nua.compiler.places"
local program = require "nua.compiler.program"
local contracts = require "nua.compiler.contracts"

return define
    ..values
    ..places
    ..program
    ..contracts
end
